[gd_scene load_steps=3 format=3 uid="uid://unitdecalemissionmap"]

; One variable: `texture_emission` on a decal with no albedo. Godot adds the emission beside the
; albedo branch, so the footprint glows in the checkerboard's pattern at twice its energy. A decal
; with an emission alone draws, where one with a normal or ORM map alone does not. `unit-decal`
; and the other decal scenes carry an albedo alone, so none of them shows an emission.

